## Conditional Inference Tree

The conditional inference tree is fitted independently within each branch. Therefore, the same predictor can appear in more than one branch when it is statistically informative for different subgroups of the data.

```{r conditional-inference-tree, fig.width=12, fig.height=8, dpi=160, out.width="100%", fig.cap="Conditional inference tree for heating load"}
